e largest and fastest-growing e-commerce markets in the world.\\u0026lt;/p\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;p\\u0026gt;\\u0026lt;strong\\u0026gt;Role Overview\\u0026lt;/strong\\u0026gt;\\u0026lt;/p\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;p\\u0026gt;Since its launch in 2019, Coupang Eats has achieved remarkable growth in the highly competitive delivery market. As a multi-sided platform serving consumers, merchants, and delivery partners, Coupang Eats provides innovative experiences and services. Leveraging Coupang’s advanced technology and operational expertise, Coupang Eats has built a fast-paced, proactive startup culture. Team members—including product owners, operations, and engineers—collaborate to solve problems with the goal of continuous customer satisfaction.\\u0026lt;/p\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;p\\u0026gt;\\u0026lt;strong\\u0026gt;What You Will Do\\u0026lt;/strong\\u0026gt;\\u0026lt;/p\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;ul\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;li\\u0026gt;Develop new features for the Coupang Eats app\\u0026lt;/li\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;li\\u0026gt;Improve app performance for faster and more reliable user experiences\\u0026lt;/li\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;li\\u0026gt;Build reusable and scalable common modules\\u0026lt;/li\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;li\\u0026gt;Collaborate closely with Product, UX, and Backend teams to deliver high-quality projects\\u0026lt;/li\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;/ul\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;p\\u0026gt;\\u0026lt;strong\\u0026gt;Basic Qualifications\\u0026lt;/strong\\u0026gt;\\u0026lt;/p\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;ul\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;li\\u0026gt;BTech or Masters as the minimum qualification\\u0026lt;/li\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;li\\u0026gt;2+ years of Android app development experience\\u0026lt;/li\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;li\\u0026gt;Solid understanding of the Android platform and Kotlin\\u0026lt;/li\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;li\\u0026gt;Strong problem-solving skills\\u0026lt;/li\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;li\\u0026gt;Clear communication skills and a sense of ownership\\u0026lt;/li\\u0026gt;\\n\\u0026lt;/ul\\u